2. **An `IDEA_NAME`** → resume from the first non-`done` stage. If it is finalized, reopen only when the request says to revisit it; otherwise ask whether to reopen or route to `star-plan-coach <slug>`.
3. No argument → resume the single unfinished idea. If several exist, ask which; if none exists, ask for the seed.
+++ 2
2. **An `IDEA_NAME`** → resume from the first non-`done` stage. If it is finalized, reopen only when the request says to revisit it; otherwise ask via AskUserQuestion whether to reopen or route to `star-plan-coach <slug>`.
3. No argument → resume the single unfinished idea. If several exist, ask which via AskUserQuestion; if none exists, ask for the seed in plain text.
